templateVersions.content:
Rate how well the candidate fits the job, from 0 to 100.

Job:
{!$Input:job}

Candidate:
{!$Input:candidate}

Guide: 85-100 has nearly all required skills and the experience; 65-84 strong with small gaps; 45-64 partial fit; 20-44 weak; 0-19 different field. Count related skills and real project use. Do not give 0 only because the industry or job title wording differs.

Return ONLY this JSON, no code fences:
{"score": 0, "strengths": "max 20 words", "gaps": "max 20 words"}

Rate how well the candidate fits the job, from 0 to 100.
Job: {!$Input:job}
Candidate: {!$Input:candidate}
Rules: 1. Judge ONLY against what the Job lists (skills, experience, role, qualifications). Skills or tools the candidate has that the Job does not ask for are never a gap and never lower the score. 2. If the candidate has all the listed skills and the experience, score 85 or more. 3. A different location takes off at most 5 points. A missing certificate takes off at most 5 points, unless the Job asks for one. 4. Guide: 85-100 has nearly all required skills and the experience; 65-84 strong with small gaps; 45-64 partial fit; 20-44 weak; 0-19 different field. Count related skills and real project use. Do not give 0 only because the industry or job title wording differs. 5. "gaps" may only name things the Job asks for that the candidate lacks; write "None" if nothing is missing.
Return ONLY this JSON, no code fences: {"score": 0, "strengths": "max 20 words", "gaps": "max 20 words"}
